- fixed icon.library to load/write device icons properly (it would just fail
  before if 'disk' wasn't concatenated), bumped to 41.27
- fixed a bug that would show 'disk.info' within the device's window, as well
  as not showing it within deeper directories
- added a 'ParseURI' command
- when a label split require a larger width because a line other than the
  first one couldn't be cut, it would print the first line again

[released: 25-08-2003/01:34:39]

1.31
----
- removed all the internal stuff regarding icon caching, will be back in
  another form
- if ambient fails to start it no longer lets bigfoot's shell without dos
  requesters
- format window sorts the device entries by name
- major speedup of icon loading
- renamed 'WBStartup' to 'Startup'
- added 'noarrow' variable to disable arrows over shortcuts
- added 'RefreshVars' command to update variables
- added multiple view support, major rewrite. Tons of stuff changed, expect
  new bugs to show up and old ones to disappear (or not)
- double buffering is only updated when needed, major overall speedup
- finally fixed the bug which allowed to have a messed up background when
  moving an icon would shrink a virtual group
- major speedup for layout stuff
- old icons palette remapping uses a gradient for undefined colors
- changed the pointer for more precise cow capture
- fixed menus not available in titlebar hiding mode
- fixed crash when using the 'quit' menu
- fixed possible screen titlebar crashing on exit
- wbstartup's startpri was ignored
- added inline renaming/relabeling
- renaming/relabeling is now threaded like it should always have been
- added always to front/back for panels
- multiple drag & drop's radial alpha effect now centers around the pointer
- same for the drag & drop target symbol
- new "sort by name" grid alignement
- added 'nohover' variable to disable hovering
- recursive deletion aborts and tells which file failed

[released: 09-01-2004/05:45:53]

1.32
----
- grmbl. I broke "System prefs" launching
- viewmode is remembered properly in the context menu for inherited views
- "allow zipping" is now default for panels
- now enables wildstar, touch sys:prefs/ambient/vars/nowildstar if you want
  things to break
- fixed unlimited loop when trying to sort by name when there's not enough
  vertical space
- significantly reduced memory usage by picture.datatype images
- and another icon layout speedup
- well, rewrote the layouter majorly. Now has an automatic layout mode
- added some audio driver system
- added ogg vorbis and mp3 decoding
- added imageview (only jpegs for now)

[released: 11-02-2004/17:44:42]

1.33
----
- faster initial layout
- readded icon downscaling
- removed .backdrop support because I declare it obsolete, har
- removed 'snapshot' over shortcut icons, it's automatic now
- and as a bonus it stops removing them all at once
- a shell should be spawned on any startup failure now
- fixed background centering
- scaled backgrounds now use the high quality internal scaling
- infowin cannot block anymore
- infowin finds out some capabilities of partitions and displays them
- inline renaming changes are immediate

[released: 29-02-2004/04:10:00]

1.34
----
- fixed playing very small samples
- fixed sound buffer status report
- autolayout is enabled except for rootwin
- notification support

[released: 15-03-2004/01:37:21]

1.35
----
- some path were recognized as mimetype.. fixed
- it's possible to copy .info files without matching file/dir as well
- added a new scaling mode for large downscalings
- added rudimentary keyboard navigation into the imageview. space advances one
  image and backspace goes one back
- added multimedia sound support
- added datatypes sound support
- added a sound control window

[released: 18-03-2004/01:41:54]

1.36
----
- limited picture navigation to roughly 5 pics/second to avoid autorepeat
  overflows
- imageview now has a correct window size for pictures bigger than the current
  screen
- imageview has an original picture size mode with scrolling
- fixed rows/lines of empty pixels during resizing with some cases
- 's' in the imageview switches between original size or scaled
- imageview displays some additional infos
- fixed a recent bug where removeables wouldn't show up
- version scanning could read random memory
- added a text view
- devices are automatically snapshoted

[released: 31-03-2004/17:53:53]

1.37
----
- altivec support
- fixed removable icon dispose once again
- datatypes recognize any image and any sound
- scaling engine uses altivec for downscaling
- fixed aspect ratio calculation
- added support for datatypes returning 8-bit sound
- multimedia subsystem recognizes any datatype that can be handled by one of
  its decoder
- changing picture in the imageview updates the title
- added boopsiview
- now traps 'multiview'
- workaround for datatypes returning planar bitmap formats
- fixed scripts (+s) launching again

[released: 16-04-2004/00:42:39]

1.38
----
- tries to open a shell if exec version is wrong
- getting a directory size would never stop
- abording some threads would hit in rare cases
- datatype errors get reported properly on imageview
- fixed prefspool randomly crashing when flushing the entries
- reworked panelconfig window
- restructured prefs presentation a bit
- added double buffering to imageview
- panels are compatible with MUI's new immediate images/frames changes
- fixed recently introduced crash when saving icons
- finally fixed the virtgroup background offset thingey
- removed ghost effect for deficons
- no more grouped context menu in rootwin

[released: 27-04-2004/16:08:30]

1.39
----
- fixed background pens
- fixed image update when renaming
- fixed immediate snapshot of pngicon's windows
- added workaround for silly filesystems (all amiga filesystems but sfs)
  returning a lock for non existing filenames. Only Amiga makes it possible
- foobar.info without corresponding foobar defaults to WBTOOL and no longer
  WBGARBAGE. Bumped icon.library to 41.35
- stacksize of programs was ignored in some cases
- now uses png.library and z.library
- creating a directory is async like it should've been in the first place
- reading fonts is async too
- icon.library uses png.library, bumped to 41.36
- fixes duplicate icons appearing when copying/moving
- icons appearing in non showall window when copying don't appear anymore
  (#127)
- reduced 68k stacksize usage
- fixed some funky side effects zeropage reads
- added icon replacing through drag & drop to the infowindow
- icons could show up without font at all
- added thumbnails support
- icon.library would fail to recognize devices without disk.info properly,
  bumped to 41.37
- now tries to keep a minimal number of threads under low memory situations
- uses syscon: to spawn the initial shell
- more flexible threads control, fixes lot of related problems
- continues thumbnailing if there was an error (broken picture, out of memory,
etc..)
- added bubbles help over files
- traps 'more' too
- device type is displayed in the infowin
- reduced CPU usage during file copy
- requesters are displayed for all error cases during copy/move operations
- new notify system could make recursive copy busyloop sometimes, fixed
- removed 'default tool' from devices in the infowin

[released: 04-09-2004/17:53:32]

1.40
----
- fixed default icons without file
- hopefully fixed all the infowin crashes Piru had :)
- requesters always appear on front now
- recursive deletion is aborted on quit
- added requesters for deletion
- window title doesn't add '..' for path components when not needed
- added more workarounds for the damn OF
- fixed crash when playing audio datatypes
- added support for itix' OS4Emu
- devices can be dragged into the infowin
- execute command window's 'Ok' button is greyed out when needed
- ditto for infowin
- icontype is updated on drag & drop in the infowin as well
- bubbles only appear once and don't follow the mouse pointer anymore
- rewrote multimedia support for the new multimedia system
- internal scaler didn't use all features for background scaling
- imageview won't make MUI barf on too large pictures anymore

